# EXPORT the traced ray data as text after an OPD (cmdref: Prescription I/O): mode TEXt, ALLRays, the
# RAYPos 3-vectors then the RAYL (cumulative optical length) scalars, Q to end.  The file is written beside
# the deck as <deck>.txt, so the deck is a COPY in $TMP.  With the default CHFRay only, the obscured chief
# ray of this telescope exports 0 rays (OBS POSITIVE is honored) -- hence ALLRays here.
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in
cd $TMP
old $DECK
opd 5
/null
export
tex
allrays
raypos
rayl
q
! head -2 $TMP/Cassegrain.in.txt
! wc -l $TMP/Cassegrain.in.txt
# EXPECT: Exporting data to \S+/Cassegrain\.in\.txt
# EXPECT: % RayPos 3-vectors for\s+1756 rays at Element\s+5
# EXPECT: % CumRayL scalars for\s+1756 rays at Element\s+5
# EXPECT: ^\s+1\s+0\.28515551\d+D-10\s+0\.10309331\d+D-09\s+0\.150000000000000D\+01
# EXPECT: ^3514 \S+/Cassegrain\.in\.txt
# EXPECT-NOT: No data has been generated
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
